+    "deepseek-chat": "deepseek-v4-flash", "deepseek-reasoner": "deepseek-v4-flash"}
 
 
 def _normalize_for_deepseek(model_name: str) -> str:
-    """Fold retired DeepSeek aliases onto their replacement; pass everything else through."""
+    """Fold retired DeepSeek aliases onto their replacement; pass everything else through.
+
+    Lucaryin override (patch 0006): canonicalize any vision request onto the image-capable
+    ``deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp`` (plain flash rejects images), so a deepseek main/aux
+    provider routes images correctly instead of 400-ing on the vision-less chat model.
